            "review_title": "Review at Loan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lee S\nPalmerston North, New Zealand461 contributions\n0\nFantastic Food\nMay 2018 • Solo\nThe restaurant is on a busy corner, so you can watch the traffic and people go by as you dine.\n\nThe menu offers a wide selection of Vietnamese dishes. There were a lot of locals eating there which is always a good sign.\n\nThe food was delicious and well priced. A can of beer sold for as little as 18,000 dong ($1.15 NZ).\n\nService was friendly and efficient. They provide a menu in English which was helpful.\n\nOne nice option was a banh mi (a small baguette) which they briefly barbecue over a charcol burner - delicious\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 12, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-13",
